That original client (vanilla JavaScript, CesiumJS, Google Photorealistic 3D
Tiles, optional OpenAI Realtime) remains the canonical inspectable source for
the Cesium + billed-maps architecture. This repository ships a free-tier
Cloudflare Worker + Three.js globe that does not include that code, those
assets, or those API keys.

Third-party data fetched at runtime (OpenSky, SatNOGS, USGS, Launch Library 2,
Nominatim, NASA / unpkg globe textures, and others) remains under each
provider's terms and is not covered by the MIT grant on this source.
